%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: coloured pattern fill, and a pattern in the dump. The first
% fill with the instance captures its cell into one pattern resource
% (the paint procedure's marks in pattern space, clipped to the box),
% and the fill names the pattern as its colour.
/P << /PatternType 1 /PaintType 1 /TilingType 1 /BBox [0 0 10 10]
  /XStep 10 /YStep 10 /PaintProc { pop 0 0 5 5 rectfill } >> matrix makepattern def
P setpattern
100 100 200 100 rectfill
showpage
